{
  "info": {
    "name": "AR-WC3 Backend",
    "description": "Exemples d'appels pour l'API AR-WC3 Backend (Spring Boot), sécurisée par JWT.\n\nUtilisation : lancer d'abord 'Auth > Login', qui enregistre automatiquement le jeton dans la variable de collection {{accessToken}}. Toutes les autres requêtes l'envoient ensuite via l'en-tête Authorization: Bearer.\n\nLe jeton expire au bout de 15 minutes : relancer Login si les appels repassent en 401.\n\nAttention : l'authentification est déléguée à Oracle (ouverture d'une connexion JDBC avec les identifiants saisis). username/password doivent donc correspondre à un compte Oracle existant sur la base ciblée.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (identifiants valides)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Statut 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code !== 200) { return; }",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('success = true', () => body.success === true);",
                  "pm.test('accessToken present', () => typeof body.accessToken === 'string' && body.accessToken.length > 0);",
                  "pm.test('tokenType = Bearer', () => body.tokenType === 'Bearer');",
                  "pm.test('expiresIn = 900 s (15 min)', () => body.expiresIn === 900);",
                  "pm.test('profil utilisateur renvoye', () => !!body.user && !!body.user.username);",
                  "",
                  "// Le jeton est stocke en variable de collection : les requetes suivantes",
                  "// l'utilisent automatiquement via l'auth Bearer heritee.",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "",
                  "// Decodage du payload pour verifier la duree de vie reelle du jeton.",
                  "try {",
                  "    const parts = body.accessToken.split('.');",
                  "    pm.test('JWT bien forme (3 parties)', () => parts.length === 3);",
                  "",
                  "    const payload = JSON.parse(atob(parts[1].replace(/-/g, '+').replace(/_/g, '/')));",
                  "    pm.test('exp - iat = 900 s', () => (payload.exp - payload.iat) === 900);",
                  "",
                  "    console.log('sub         :', payload.sub);",
                  "    console.log('displayName :', payload.displayName);",
                  "    console.log('expire le   :', new Date(payload.exp * 1000).toISOString());",
                  "} catch (e) {",
                  "    console.log('Decodage du payload impossible :', e.message);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Seule route publique du contrat (security: [] dans openapi.yaml). Les identifiants passent dans le corps de la requête, plus dans un en-tête Basic.\n\nLe script de test enregistre accessToken dans les variables de collection."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (identifiants invalides -> 401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Statut 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
                  "pm.test(\"message d'erreur present\", () => pm.response.json().message !== undefined);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"mauvais-mot-de-passe\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Oracle refuse la connexion JDBC, AuthService lève une BadCredentialsException, AuthExceptionHandler la traduit en 401 + ErrorResponse."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (password manquant -> 400)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Statut 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "password est requis dans le contrat : la @Valid du contrôleur généré rejette la requête avant d'atteindre le service."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Statistics",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Récupérer les statistiques du dashboard",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Statut 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('contient stat1..stat4', () => ['stat1','stat2','stat3','stat4'].every(k => Array.isArray(body[k])));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/statistics",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "statistics"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Hérite de l'auth Bearer de la collection : JwtAuthenticationFilter valide {{accessToken}} et peuple le SecurityContext."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Statistics sans jeton -> 401",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Statut 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
                  "pm.test(\"message d'erreur present\", () => pm.response.json().message !== undefined);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/statistics",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "statistics"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Vérifie que l'authenticationEntryPoint de SecurityConfig répond un 401 JSON quand l'en-tête Authorization est absent."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Dossier sinistre",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Recherche paginée",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Statut 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('page de resultats', () => Array.isArray(body.data) && typeof body.totalCount === 'number');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"finNull\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/prestations-prevoyance/dossier-sinistre/recherche?page=0&size=20",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "prestations-prevoyance",
                "dossier-sinistre",
                "recherche"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "0"
                },
                {
                  "key": "size",
                  "value": "20"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "username",
      "value": "system"
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": ""
    }
  ]
}
